sequenceDiagram
    title Customer Chat Journey: "Is the Globomantics Pro waterproof?"

    actor User as Customer
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Cache as Semantic Cache<br/>(Redis)
    participant Orch as Chat Orchestrator
    participant Guard as Guardrails
    participant Emb as Embedding Service
    participant DB as pgvector
    participant LLM

    User->>GW: POST /v1/chat {message, session_id}
    Note right of GW: Auth + rate limit (10ms)

    GW->>Cache: Check semantic cache (cosine > 0.95)
    alt Cache HIT
        Cache-->>GW: Cached response
        GW-->>User: Response (from cache)
    else Cache MISS
        Cache-->>GW: No match

        GW->>Orch: Forward request
        activate Orch

        Orch->>Guard: Check input (PII, prompt injection)
        Note right of Guard: (30ms)
        Guard-->>Orch: Pass

        Note right of Orch: Intent classification (80ms)
        Orch->>Orch: Classify intent → "product_question"

        Orch->>Emb: Embed query
        Note right of Emb: (40ms)
        Emb-->>Orch: Query vector

        Orch->>DB: retrieve(query_vec, top_k=3, category="speakers")
        Note right of DB: (120ms)
        DB-->>Orch: 3 product spec chunks

        Orch->>Orch: Assemble prompt (system + history + chunks)

        Orch->>LLM: Generate {messages, tools, ...}
        Note right of LLM: (800ms)
        LLM-->>Orch: Full response

        Orch->>Guard: Check full response (toxicity, PII leaks, policy)
        Note right of Guard: (40ms)
        Guard-->>Orch: Pass

        Orch-->>GW: Response + metadata
        deactivate Orch
        GW-->>User: Response

        GW->>Cache: Store response (query embedding + answer)
    end

    Note over User, LLM: Total: ~1.3s (cache miss) | ~50ms (cache hit)